      "writtenOn": "2019-07-25T00:10:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I assume this is reflecting some diagram in the spec. Can you point me to it?\n\nIf I read the code correctly, tc_cc_rp_entry will be called whenever we enter unattached.src, attachwait.src. These two are next to each other. I\u0027m trying to understand how this hierarchy makes the code more readable (by calling tc_cc_rp_entry twice in a row).",
